{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01XoQY6LKqjTrsX1K95d6Yxe","type":"tool_result","content":"20\tContract: `https://wa.me/<phone>?text=<urlencoded template>`.\n21\tTemplates stored in Configuration (editable by M): missing-info request, dimension\n22\tconfirmation, quotation delivery, approval reminder, payment reminder, payment\n23\tconfirmation, production handoff, delivery-ready. Human reviews and sends manually.\n24\tNo inbound automation in MVP.\n25\t\n26\t## 4. Existing Web Quotation Tool (Route D) — discovery (DIS-002)\n27\t\n28\tNeeded: screenshots or technical access, its operational restrictions (min part size,\n29\tface orientation) to fold into canonical validation layer. Target contract: tool creates/\n30\tupdates ticket + attaches original request, normalized parts, estimate, cutting plan, export file.\n31\t\n32\t## 5. CSV/XLSX Customer Import (Phase 2)\n33\t\n34\tInbound adapter: file → column-mapping UI → canonical Parts draft → validation report\n35\t(missing/invalid/ambiguous flagged) → advisor applies. Mapping stored per Imports row\n36\t(`mapping_json`) for reuse. Unit conversion to mm recorded with provenance.\n37\t\n38\t## 6. Future (out of MVP)\n39\t\n40\tWhatsApp Business API (bidirectional), n8n automations, bank-email parsing, OCR/AI intake.\n41\tEach requires its own ADR + discovery ticket before any implementation ticket.\n42\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"d4b5d03f-b371-4da0-a10c-c737546cf8ca","uuid":"5f52cfa6-38d7-4209-beea-517486401712","timestamp":"2026-07-18T03:45:51.782Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/Users/work945/Documents/Proyectos/ABM/proyectos/panel-ops/integration-contracts.md","content":"Contract: `https://wa.me/<phone>?text=<urlencoded template>`.\nTemplates stored in Configuration (editable by M): missing-info request, dimension\nconfirmation, quotation delivery, approval reminder, payment reminder, payment\nconfirmation, production handoff, delivery-ready. Human reviews and sends manually.\nNo inbound automation in MVP.\n\n## 4. Existing Web Quotation Tool (Route D) — discovery (DIS-002)\n\nNeeded: screenshots or technical access, its operational restrictions (min part size,\nface orientation) to fold into canonical validation layer. Target contract: tool creates/\nupdates ticket + attaches original request, normalized parts, estimate, cutting plan, export file.\n\n## 5. CSV/XLSX Customer Import (Phase 2)\n\nInbound adapter: file → column-mapping UI → canonical Parts draft → validation report\n(missing/invalid/ambiguous flagged) → advisor applies. Mapping stored per Imports row\n(`mapping_json`) for reuse. Unit conversion to mm recorded with provenance.\n\n## 6. Future (out of MVP)\n\nWhatsApp Business API (bidirectional), n8n automations, bank-email parsing, OCR/AI intake.\nEach requires its own ADR + discovery ticket before any implementation ticket.\n","numLines":23,"startLine":20,"totalLines":42}}}
